From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:45:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 604/604] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt6797: end the USB11 T-PHY's
 shared window at its port

The USB11 T-PHY's shared register window covered 0x11210000-0x11210fff,
which includes its U2 port at 0x11210800. The driver maps both, so the
port's region request failed with -EBUSY and the PHY did not probe on
station boot c85e7cb8. End the shared window at 0x800, as the SSUSB
T-PHY's already does.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797.dtsi
index b8a507ec3..94884ab9f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797.dtsi
@@ -187,7 +187,7 @@ u3port0: usb-phy@11290900 {
 
 	usb11_tphy: t-phy@11210000 {
 		compatible = "mediatek,mt6797-tphy", "mediatek,generic-tphy-v1";
-		reg = <0 0x11210000 0 0x1000>;
+		reg = <0 0x11210000 0 0x800>;
 		#address-cells = <2>;
 		#size-cells = <2>;
 		ranges;
-- 
2.43.0

